# NX design language color scheme (nx-hub docs/DESIGN.md)
# Liquid glass on deep space: violet #7700FF dominates, cyan #00e5ff marks
# live/active state, amber #ffb300 attention, red #ff5470 danger only.
# Applied app-locally by the dashboard; never installed as a system scheme.

